 "remarks": "Bright Two-Bedroom in the Heart of Downtown Stamford Live at the center of everything in this two-bedroom, 1 bath apartment in downtown Stamford. An open living and dining area flows into a modern kitchen with ample cabinets. It works equally well for quiet nights in and hosting friends. Both bedrooms are generously sized, with primary with large walk-in and the second bedroom makes an easy home office or guest room. Additional features include in-unit washer/dryer, central air, hardwood floors. Step outside and you're minutes from Bedford Street's restaurants and cafes, Mill River Park, and the shops at Stamford Town Center. Commuters will love the easy walk or short ride to the Stamford Transportation Center, with Metro-North express service to Grand Central in under an hour, plus quick access to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway.",
